WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.475
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.745 --> 01:44.625
Today is September 30.

3
01:44.705 --> 01:47.105
This is the first email I've written to you.

4
01:47.185 --> 01:49.345
I'm sending it later than I expected.

5
01:50.705 --> 01:53.545
I've rented an apartment near the research institute.

6
01:53.625 --> 01:55.425
Lately, I've discovered what it's like

7
01:55.505 --> 01:58.505
to carry everything you own on your back.

8
01:59.665 --> 02:01.705
It made me think of you.

9
02:05.305 --> 02:07.305
I often walk to the institute.

10
02:07.385 --> 02:09.265
-The streets are beautiful. -Morning.

11
02:09.345 --> 02:11.785
I've noticed an interesting habit among Germans.

12
02:11.865 --> 02:13.065
When you're walking outside,

13
02:13.145 --> 02:14.585
if you make eye contact with someone,

14
02:14.665 --> 02:17.225
they'll greet you with "Good morning."

15
02:21.505 --> 02:23.385
I met up with a friend on the weekend.

16
02:23.465 --> 02:24.985
His name is Qin Sizhi.

17
02:25.545 --> 02:28.905
Before the accident, he was my best friend at school.

18
02:30.225 --> 02:33.825
Afterward, as you know, I distanced myself from everyone,

19
02:35.345 --> 02:36.985
even my former self.

20
02:38.945 --> 02:40.945
Seeing him again made me realize

21
02:41.025 --> 02:43.345
that reconnecting isn't that hard.

22
02:46.785 --> 02:48.585
Even though my colleagues speak English at work,

23
02:48.665 --> 02:51.505
I've started learning German anyway.

24
02:51.585 --> 02:53.225
The pronunciation is difficult.

25
02:53.305 --> 02:55.545
It feels like something's stuck in my throat.

26
02:57.185 --> 02:59.465
An Italian at the institute told me

27
02:59.545 --> 03:02.425
that learning a new language is like learning to speak all over again.

28
03:03.105 --> 03:04.265
He was right.

29
03:04.985 --> 03:06.625
I MISS YOU

30
03:06.705 --> 03:10.745
Ich vermisse dich.

31
03:14.465 --> 03:15.705
What about Qingyi?

32
03:15.785 --> 03:16.985
Has it started getting colder?

33
03:19.785 --> 03:21.225
It got colder for a bit,

34
03:21.305 --> 03:24.265
but the temperature soon climbed back up into the twenties again.

35
03:25.465 --> 03:28.225
My life isn't as eventful as the weather.

36
03:28.305 --> 03:30.065
Each day, I just go back and forth

37
03:30.145 --> 03:33.025
between my internship, the lab, and my dorm.

38
03:34.025 --> 03:36.425
But I feel a sense of peace despite all the business.

39
03:38.545 --> 03:40.065
On my way back to the university,

40
03:40.145 --> 03:41.785
I got caught in a sun-shower.

41
03:41.865 --> 03:44.225
My roommate said my bangs were dripping wet,

42
03:44.305 --> 03:45.785
and I looked like a bedraggled cat.

43
03:48.065 --> 03:49.945
But I like sun-showers

44
03:50.025 --> 03:54.825
because I know they mean the rain will soon be over,

45
03:54.905 --> 03:57.105
and there's a good chance a rainbow will appear.

46
03:59.265 --> 04:02.265
Bi Dezheng's catchphrase these days is…

47
04:03.785 --> 04:05.625
If only Chen Yanzhou were here.

48
04:06.665 --> 04:09.185
He still resents you for going abroad.

49
04:09.265 --> 04:11.305
But every time he says that,

50
04:11.385 --> 04:13.425
he puts his head down and gets the work done.

51
04:14.145 --> 04:15.905
I think he'll graduate just fine.

52
04:17.905 --> 04:21.624
Oh, right. I have good news.

53
04:21.705 --> 04:24.145
The potted plant you gave me has bloomed again.

54
04:24.225 --> 04:27.625
This might be its last flowering season.

55
04:28.625 --> 04:29.825
I'll take good care of it.

56
04:31.625 --> 04:33.185
After reading your email,

57
04:33.265 --> 04:35.745
I bought a potted plant too and put it in my apartment.

58
04:36.665 --> 04:38.025
But winter is coming.

59
04:38.105 --> 04:40.065
I don't know how long it'll survive,

60
04:40.905 --> 04:42.985
especially with so little sunlight here.

61
04:43.985 --> 04:46.585
The leaves in the nearby park have already turned yellow.

62
04:47.105 --> 04:48.705
One day, as I was passing by,

63
04:48.785 --> 04:51.225
a leaf fell onto my shoulder.

64
04:51.305 --> 04:55.105
It reminded me of that time we did light trapping.

65
04:55.185 --> 04:56.425
A butterfly

66
04:56.505 --> 04:57.905
once landed on your shoulder.

67
04:59.265 --> 05:02.705
A German colleague saw the leaf I kept in my book

68
05:02.785 --> 05:04.305
and called me romantic.

69
05:05.345 --> 05:08.745
But I really just wanted to share it with you.

70
05:08.825 --> 05:10.745
That's why I kept it.

71
05:11.505 --> 05:15.065
Maybe the act of sharing is romantic in itself.

72
05:17.785 --> 05:20.265
I bought a cake from a bakery today.

73
05:20.345 --> 05:22.825
The old lady running the shop asked me to write something on it.

74
05:22.905 --> 05:25.305
I remembered what you said about sun-showers,

75
05:25.385 --> 05:29.025
so I wrote, "The sun is shining, but it's raining."

76
05:29.105 --> 05:30.745
Is my German getting better?

77
05:33.385 --> 05:36.145
I've been spending more and more time at the institute lately.

78
05:36.225 --> 05:38.385
The data came out wrong several times,

79
05:38.465 --> 05:42.665
but my German lecturer told me that failure was data too.

80
05:42.745 --> 05:46.105
I took those words to heart and went back to working overtime.

81
05:46.185 --> 05:48.425
On my way home, I realized it was snowing.

82
05:48.505 --> 05:50.385
After walking for ten minutes,

83
05:50.465 --> 05:52.145
my ears were aching from the cold.

84
05:53.145 --> 05:55.105
It must be cold in Qingyi by now too.

85
05:55.185 --> 05:56.585
Remember to rug up.

86
05:57.985 --> 05:59.505
During my lunch break,

87
05:59.585 --> 06:02.425
I sneak off alone to eat lunch in a park near the company.

88
06:03.945 --> 06:08.505
I used to think I only ate to stay alive,

89
06:08.585 --> 06:10.705
so anything would do.

90
06:10.785 --> 06:11.745
No need to waste money.

91
06:15.265 --> 06:18.185
But now, it's like my taste buds have awakened.

92
06:20.745 --> 06:22.425
Is there any good food in Germany?

93
06:23.145 --> 06:25.025
It can't just be hot chocolate, right?

94
06:26.705 --> 06:27.545
Oh, right.

95
06:27.625 --> 06:30.385
I transferred some money to your account.

96
06:30.465 --> 06:31.585
Make sure you check it.

97
06:36.625 --> 06:39.505
This winter break, my roommates didn't go home right away.

98
06:40.345 --> 06:41.985
Linlin is preparing for grad school exams,

99
06:42.545 --> 06:44.145
and Zhuang Ning has started an internship.

100
06:46.465 --> 06:47.945
As for Fangli,

101
06:48.585 --> 06:49.865
she's in a relationship now.

102
06:49.945 --> 06:51.625
Apparently, he's her childhood sweetheart.

103
06:51.705 --> 06:53.065
Song Mo!

104
07:04.225 --> 07:07.865
As for me, guess who I'm spending Lunar New Year with this year?

105
07:07.945 --> 07:09.665
You just set off all those fireworks.

106
07:09.745 --> 07:10.985
I'm saving these for my sister.

107
07:11.065 --> 07:13.225
Ms. Zheng said I could play with them all.

108
07:13.305 --> 07:14.985
She was just being polite.

109
07:15.065 --> 07:16.025
No, she wasn't!

110
07:16.105 --> 07:17.265
You're so stingy!

111
07:17.345 --> 07:19.665
If Yanzhou were here, you wouldn't dare treat me like this.

112
07:19.745 --> 07:21.025
Why wouldn't I dare?

113
07:21.105 --> 07:23.745
If he were here, you wouldn't get to play with any of these.

114
07:23.825 --> 07:24.985
They'd all go to my sister.

115
07:25.705 --> 07:26.745
You're lying.

116
07:27.905 --> 07:29.905
-Give them to me! -No!

117
07:29.985 --> 07:32.065
-Give them to me! -No!

118
07:32.145 --> 07:33.665
-Give me some! -Give me some!

119
07:33.745 --> 07:34.825
I'll light them for you.

120
07:38.625 --> 07:39.625
Here.

121
07:42.585 --> 07:44.025
Chen Yanzhou.

122
07:44.105 --> 07:45.625
Happy Lunar New Year.

123
07:52.785 --> 07:55.185
Regarding the good food that you asked about last time,

124
07:55.265 --> 07:57.505
I've found a new answer this spring.

125
07:58.505 --> 08:00.665
I can finally eat eggs again.

126
08:00.745 --> 08:03.145
Maybe this means I've fully recovered.

127
08:04.905 --> 08:07.825
A professor at the institute found out I was learning German,

128
08:07.905 --> 08:09.705
so he gave me a prompt.

129
08:09.785 --> 08:12.825
I thought about it for a week and eventually wrote,

130
08:12.905 --> 08:17.705
"I don't long for distant places, because I'm already far from home."

131
08:18.745 --> 08:22.265
"But there's one person I feel homesick for."

132
08:23.065 --> 08:24.225
Zheng Yu.

133
08:24.305 --> 08:26.265
Summer is coming again.

134
08:26.345 --> 08:28.025
You've worked so hard for so long.

135
08:28.105 --> 08:30.065
Have you given yourself a break?

136
08:30.665 --> 08:31.745
I haven't gone on vacation.

137
08:31.825 --> 08:32.745
PAYEE NAME: WU FA

138
08:32.825 --> 08:35.985
But I did something that made me even happier.

139
08:36.065 --> 08:37.825
I paid off the last of my debt.

140
08:41.945 --> 08:43.505
And there's more good news.

141
08:44.264 --> 08:47.905
Zheng Yu! Have you checked our paper's submission status?

142
08:48.545 --> 08:49.945
Our paper got accepted!

143
08:50.865 --> 08:52.505
-Really? -Yes!

144
08:54.225 --> 08:55.225
See for yourself.

145
09:00.785 --> 09:04.985
Should we tell Chen Yanzhou?

146
09:05.065 --> 09:06.865
After all, he put a lot of work into this too.

147
09:06.945 --> 09:08.305
Of course!

148
09:08.905 --> 09:11.905
I'll leave it to you to let him know.

149
09:13.785 --> 09:14.705
No problem.

150
09:16.305 --> 09:18.185
There's a job fair at the cafeteria this afternoon.

151
09:18.265 --> 09:19.665
Do you want to check it out together?

152
09:19.745 --> 09:21.385
It's the last job fair before we graduate.

153
09:22.745 --> 09:24.305
I think I'll pass.

154
09:26.625 --> 09:28.265
You are

155
09:29.865 --> 09:31.705
not studying for the grad school entrance exams,

156
09:31.785 --> 09:33.905
and you're skipping campus recruitment.

157
09:35.185 --> 09:36.585
Zheng Yu.

158
09:38.145 --> 09:40.585
You're not

159
09:41.385 --> 09:43.385
planning on giving up on everything, are you?

160
09:45.065 --> 09:46.305
No.

161
09:46.385 --> 09:47.305
Just wait a bit longer.

162
09:47.385 --> 09:49.785
Once everything is settled, I'll tell you.

163
09:51.785 --> 09:52.705
As for Xiaomian…

164
09:52.785 --> 09:53.705
Okay.

165
09:53.785 --> 09:55.225
His College Entrance Exam is coming up.

166
09:56.145 --> 09:58.345
He says he wants to attend Ji An University.

167
09:58.425 --> 10:01.905
It's only a 40-minute high-speed train ride from Qingyi.

168
10:01.985 --> 10:05.505
I guess he doesn't want to stay in Qingyi because of Jiang Haixing.

169
10:05.585 --> 10:09.065
As for why he didn't choose somewhere farther away…

170
10:09.145 --> 10:11.225
Well… that I don't know.

171
10:11.305 --> 10:12.425
Jiang Mian!

172
10:14.665 --> 10:16.905
-Aren't you sophomores already on break? -That's right.

173
10:16.985 --> 10:18.705
They need the classrooms for your exams.

174
10:19.305 --> 10:20.465
Then why are you…?

175
10:21.785 --> 10:23.665
I came to give you something.

176
10:27.785 --> 10:28.785
What is this?

177
10:29.585 --> 10:30.545
It's a lucky charm.

178
10:30.625 --> 10:33.305
They're really popular now. You didn't know?

179
10:35.985 --> 10:39.785
Well, I guess top students like you don't pay attention to these things.

180
10:40.625 --> 10:43.025
Anyway, just think of it as a good-luck charm.

181
10:43.105 --> 10:44.225
Keep it.

182
10:45.425 --> 10:48.065
And listen, you'd better get a high score.

183
10:48.145 --> 10:50.985
Otherwise, it'll be so embarrassing for me after all the tutoring you gave me.

184
10:53.225 --> 10:55.065
Okay, I should get going.

185
10:55.145 --> 10:56.185
Good luck!

186
11:05.465 --> 11:06.305
Good luck!

187
11:15.945 --> 11:19.705
When I saw your email, I was in the lab.

188
11:19.785 --> 11:22.385
I was so excited, I almost messed up a data point.

189
11:22.465 --> 11:25.465
I know it's a bit late, but congratulations!

190
11:25.545 --> 11:28.265
I can't believe Xiaomian is about to take the College Entrance Exam.

191
11:28.345 --> 11:29.865
Time really flies.

192
11:30.585 --> 11:32.025
You'll be graduating soon too.

193
11:32.745 --> 11:35.625
Do you have any plans?

194
11:35.705 --> 11:37.145
I do have a plan,

195
11:37.785 --> 11:40.345
and I've been preparing for it for a while now.

196
11:40.425 --> 11:41.265
But…

197
11:41.345 --> 11:42.505
Ms. Yang.

198
11:43.985 --> 11:47.305
Every time you come to see me, you look so much thinner than before.

199
11:48.065 --> 11:51.745
But regardless, the debt is fully paid off now,

200
11:51.825 --> 11:53.465
which is a huge weight off your shoulders.

201
11:54.825 --> 11:56.545
What about the other matter?

202
11:57.945 --> 12:00.345
Look, every time I see you,

203
12:01.225 --> 12:02.265
you're always…

204
12:02.345 --> 12:03.305
Look at you.

205
12:03.385 --> 12:04.665
You're practicing

206
12:05.585 --> 12:06.705
basic German.

207
12:06.785 --> 12:09.945
Last time, you told me the program was called

208
12:10.025 --> 12:13.865
the Sino-German Joint Master's Program, right?

209
12:13.945 --> 12:17.425
Have the results of the program's assessment come out yet?

210
12:17.505 --> 12:18.785
Yes. I passed.

211
12:19.545 --> 12:22.505
But the corporate sponsorship I applied for hasn't been approved yet,

212
12:22.585 --> 12:25.345
so I haven't told anyone about it yet.

213
12:26.585 --> 12:27.905
Corporate sponsorship…

214
12:27.985 --> 12:29.545
Is that from NingSheng BioTech?

215
12:30.505 --> 12:33.225
That female boss you told me about last time…

216
12:33.305 --> 12:35.025
I looked her up online.

217
12:36.185 --> 12:38.025
She's really impressive.

218
12:38.105 --> 12:41.385
I saw that all the people she sponsors are young women.

219
12:42.425 --> 12:44.825
Young women these days are really something.

220
12:44.905 --> 12:46.985
Back in our day, to be honest,

221
12:47.065 --> 12:49.465
we barely had the chance to get an education,

222
12:49.545 --> 12:52.945
let alone help someone else get one.

223
12:53.025 --> 12:56.585
Thank goodness my mom encouraged me to learn a few extra things.

224
12:56.665 --> 12:59.345
Otherwise, I'd be illiterate today.

225
13:00.505 --> 13:02.585
Seeing you get this opportunity,

226
13:02.665 --> 13:04.145
I'm genuinely happy for you.

227
13:04.225 --> 13:06.265
I'm thrilled!

228
13:06.345 --> 13:07.185
Thank you.

229
13:08.985 --> 13:10.545
I read online that

230
13:11.545 --> 13:14.745
sponsorship for studying abroad requires signing a contract?

231
13:14.825 --> 13:15.985
Yes.

232
13:16.065 --> 13:18.745
I'd have to sign a training and service commitment agreement.

233
13:18.825 --> 13:21.625
After graduating and returning to China, I'd have to work for their company.

234
13:21.705 --> 13:25.065
If I didn't complete the required service period, I'd be in breach of contract.

235
13:25.745 --> 13:27.225
That's complicated.

236
13:27.305 --> 13:30.745
Doesn't that mean you're committing to your future career now?

237
13:31.425 --> 13:34.265
-Aren't you worried you'll regret it? -No.

238
13:34.345 --> 13:35.905
I've visited the company,

239
13:35.985 --> 13:38.825
and I've seen how the employees work there.

240
13:38.905 --> 13:40.465
For me,

241
13:40.545 --> 13:44.585
the reason I'm working hard is to build exactly this kind of stable life.

242
13:45.385 --> 13:47.825
Besides, this company has a great reputation in Qingyi.

243
13:48.425 --> 13:51.225
All right. As long as you know what you're doing.

244
13:52.145 --> 13:54.185
Have you told Xiaochen about this?

245
13:55.145 --> 13:55.985
Not yet.

246
13:56.065 --> 13:59.825
I plan to wait until the sponsorship gets officially approved before telling him.

247
14:00.945 --> 14:01.825
Oh, you.

248
14:01.905 --> 14:05.425
You always wait until everything is settled before saying anything.

249
14:07.585 --> 14:09.185
And yet, you always see right through me.

250
14:12.025 --> 14:15.105
Still, I think Xiaochen is a good person.

251
14:15.945 --> 14:17.865
He's worth keeping in your heart.

252
14:19.145 --> 14:23.345
I support you in going out to see the wider world.

253
14:24.345 --> 14:25.745
But remember,

254
14:25.825 --> 14:28.985
you must always be your own anchor.

255
14:32.745 --> 14:34.145
Take this.

256
14:34.225 --> 14:37.625
Consider it a gift from me.

257
14:38.265 --> 14:39.345
You don't have to.

258
14:39.425 --> 14:41.985
It's just a small token. Just take it.

259
14:43.185 --> 14:44.905
As the old saying goes,

260
14:44.985 --> 14:46.385
save at home, splurge on the road.

261
14:46.465 --> 14:49.905
When you're away from home, it's hard to feel secure with empty pockets.

262
14:51.185 --> 14:52.145
Take it.

263
14:55.185 --> 14:56.025
Thank you.

264
14:56.105 --> 14:58.585
What are you thanking me for?

265
14:59.825 --> 15:00.865
That's wonderful.

266
15:08.385 --> 15:11.025
-Is your defense over? -Yes, it's over.

267
15:11.625 --> 15:13.945
Hopefully, there won't be a second defense, right?

268
15:14.785 --> 15:15.745
Song Mo,

269
15:15.825 --> 15:18.505
could you at least wish your girlfriend well?

270
15:18.585 --> 15:21.825
No, what I mean is, it's fine even if you have to do it again.

271
15:21.905 --> 15:24.745
If your graduation gets delayed, I can apply for grad school at Qing Yi.

272
15:25.465 --> 15:27.545
Then you'll even have to call me your senior.

273
15:27.625 --> 15:29.305
Either way, I come out ahead!

274
15:29.385 --> 15:33.625
If Zheng Yu hadn't asked me to invite you to thank you for helping out recently,

275
15:33.705 --> 15:35.425
you wouldn't even be sitting at this table.

276
15:35.505 --> 15:37.745
-How dare you run your mouth like that? -No…

277
15:37.825 --> 15:40.305
-You're full of it! -I…

278
15:40.385 --> 15:41.505
I surrender!

279
15:41.585 --> 15:43.025
Surrendering won't save you!

280
15:43.105 --> 15:45.905
-Go easy on him, Fangli. -Give him a break!

281
15:45.985 --> 15:47.225
Cheers!

282
15:47.305 --> 15:50.385
-Happy graduation! -Happy graduation!

283
15:54.585 --> 15:56.905
We're moving out of the dorms this week.

284
15:56.985 --> 15:59.265
Now that I think about it, I'm a little sad to leave.

285
15:59.945 --> 16:01.905
When are you all planning to move? I can come help.

286
16:02.545 --> 16:04.225
Don't worry. We'll definitely need you.

287
16:04.985 --> 16:08.105
Just to be clear, I don't need help. I'm just moving down the hall.

288
16:08.185 --> 16:11.505
Come on! Your grad school dorm is still a bit far from our place.

289
16:13.105 --> 16:14.465
Free labor!

290
16:14.985 --> 16:18.465
What about you? Are you planning to stay at the company where you interned?

291
16:19.505 --> 16:23.305
My colleagues are all pretty nice, and my boss is great too.

292
16:23.905 --> 16:26.825
Once I get my degree, they'll convert me to full-time.

293
16:29.025 --> 16:31.465
I'd like to work full-time for a while and see how it goes.

294
16:32.905 --> 16:34.625
Then you need to find a place to rent, right?

295
16:35.225 --> 16:36.985
I've already contacted a few agents.

296
16:37.065 --> 16:38.785
I'll look into some places in the next few days.

297
16:39.505 --> 16:41.425
Make sure to call us when you go house hunting.

298
16:41.505 --> 16:44.545
I've seen so many posts about fresh grads getting scammed when renting.

299
16:45.625 --> 16:47.905
If you run out of time, just leave your stuff in my room first.

300
16:47.985 --> 16:49.465
I'll hold on to it for you.

301
16:50.105 --> 16:52.345
Aw, thank you, Linlin.

302
16:52.425 --> 16:55.585
THE NINGSHENG BIOTECH SPONSORSHIP HAS BEEN APPROVED.

303
16:59.465 --> 17:02.185
Zheng Yu, how's everything going with your application to study abroad?

304
17:04.145 --> 17:05.464
Zheng Yu.

305
17:05.545 --> 17:06.424
Zheng Yu?

306
17:06.505 --> 17:07.424
Zheng Yu.

307
17:08.105 --> 17:10.585
I… I need to send an email.

308
17:10.665 --> 17:12.785
Wait, no. I need to make a call.

309
17:12.865 --> 17:13.985
Take it easy.

310
17:24.505 --> 17:25.704
CHEN YANZHOU

311
17:29.425 --> 17:30.345
Hello?

312
17:32.785 --> 17:33.665
Hello.

313
17:34.945 --> 17:36.025
Chen Yanzhou.

314
17:36.865 --> 17:40.265
Remember how you asked me if I had any plans?

315
17:44.425 --> 17:45.825
I…

316
17:47.865 --> 17:49.625
I'm going to study in Germany.

317
18:11.625 --> 18:12.785
BERLIN BRANDENBURG AIRPORT

318
18:12.865 --> 18:15.065
FIVE MONTHS LATER

319
18:51.625 --> 18:52.585
It's been a while.

320
18:54.025 --> 18:54.945
It's been a while.

321
18:57.225 --> 18:58.105
Let me take these.

322
18:59.345 --> 19:00.545
Thank you.

323
19:01.945 --> 19:02.785
And your bag?

324
19:03.705 --> 19:04.585
It's fine.

325
19:04.665 --> 19:06.585
It's really light. I can manage.

326
19:08.825 --> 19:09.985
Let's go.

327
19:22.785 --> 19:25.185
Your hair seems to have grown longer.

328
19:26.385 --> 19:27.385
I haven't cut it.

329
19:28.345 --> 19:30.025
It looks good on you.

330
19:32.785 --> 19:35.625
You, on the other hand, haven't changed much.

331
19:37.505 --> 19:40.345
I was afraid someone wouldn't recognize me,

332
19:40.425 --> 19:42.385
so I tried to look the same.

333
19:43.185 --> 19:44.905
Are you kidding?

334
19:44.985 --> 19:47.225
The moment I came out, I spotted you right away.

335
20:10.025 --> 20:11.945
So this is the apartment you applied for.

336
20:13.185 --> 20:14.825
I applied a long time ago.

337
20:14.905 --> 20:16.025
Luckily,

338
20:16.105 --> 20:18.185
I got a spot in this triple room last week.

339
20:18.265 --> 20:21.465
Even though the room is a bit small and we share a bathroom,

340
20:21.545 --> 20:24.025
the rent is cheap, and the common area is quite spacious.

341
20:25.185 --> 20:26.065
It's pretty nice here.

342
20:27.625 --> 20:29.105
You can just put my stuff here.

343
20:30.305 --> 20:31.465
Let me carry it into your room.

344
20:32.785 --> 20:33.705
Over there.

345
20:41.225 --> 20:43.265
I'll leave your things here for now.

346
20:43.345 --> 20:45.345
Is there anything else you need me to do?

347
20:46.065 --> 20:47.105
That's all.

348
20:47.185 --> 20:48.345
You must be tired from driving.

349
20:48.425 --> 20:50.105
Go back early and get some rest.

350
20:50.185 --> 20:51.025
All right.

351
20:51.105 --> 20:53.105
Get some rest too and adjust to the time difference.

352
20:55.425 --> 20:57.185
What are your plans for tomorrow?

353
20:57.265 --> 20:59.505
It's your first day in Berlin. Do you want to look around?

354
21:00.545 --> 21:01.905
That's what I had in mind.

355
21:02.785 --> 21:04.625
Let me know when you're doing that, then.

356
21:06.905 --> 21:07.745
What?

357
21:07.825 --> 21:10.825
Could it be that you've made plans with a tour guide who's not me?

358
21:11.905 --> 21:13.305
No, of course not.

359
21:14.145 --> 21:15.865
-Then… -Hi!

360
21:33.585 --> 21:35.505
Your housemate is back.

361
21:36.185 --> 21:37.385
I should get going.

362
21:39.665 --> 21:40.745
See you tomorrow.

363
21:40.825 --> 21:41.865
See you tomorrow.

364
22:48.465 --> 22:53.185
PLAN FOR TOMORROW'S LEISURELY WANDERING

365
22:53.265 --> 22:54.785
CHEN YANZHOU

366
22:54.865 --> 22:58.105
"Wandering" and "having a plan"

367
22:58.185 --> 23:00.305
don't really go together, do they?

368
23:00.385 --> 23:03.385
CHEN YANZHOU

369
23:04.865 --> 23:05.705
Hello.

370
23:05.785 --> 23:08.705
Actually, Berlin's streets are beautiful even if you just wander around.

371
23:08.785 --> 23:10.385
Then why make a plan?

372
23:10.465 --> 23:14.225
I just didn't know if there were any spots you'd be interested in,

373
23:14.305 --> 23:16.425
so I wanted to be prepared.

374
23:16.505 --> 23:17.825
Did you just get home?

375
23:19.065 --> 23:20.585
I just got home.

376
23:20.665 --> 23:22.225
Then take a little break.

377
23:22.305 --> 23:23.985
You've been driving for so long.

378
23:24.065 --> 23:25.985
Lie down on the couch for a bit.

379
23:27.905 --> 23:30.385
Listening to you talk is just as restful for me.

380
23:41.385 --> 23:42.345
What's wrong?

381
23:43.145 --> 23:44.465
Cat got your tongue?

382
23:47.305 --> 23:49.065
I was just thinking,

383
23:49.145 --> 23:50.945
you really go all out.

384
23:51.625 --> 23:54.545
You're so busy at the lab, yet you still try to be the perfect tour guide.

385
23:55.745 --> 23:59.465
It's not that bad. After all, you're the only guest I'm hosting.

386
24:00.905 --> 24:02.465
After being my tour guide,

387
24:02.545 --> 24:06.385
you might discover you have a real talent for the tourism industry.

388
24:06.465 --> 24:07.945
You could even earn extra money.

389
24:09.105 --> 24:10.265
That's not where my heart lies.

390
24:11.585 --> 24:12.785
Then

391
24:12.865 --> 24:14.305
where does it lie?

392
24:15.545 --> 24:16.905
You already know.

393
24:19.785 --> 24:22.465
All right, I'll let you get some rest.

394
24:25.825 --> 24:27.345
Well…

395
24:27.425 --> 24:28.585
See you tomorrow then.

396
24:29.465 --> 24:30.465
See you tomorrow.

397
24:32.065 --> 24:33.305
Good night.

398
24:34.985 --> 24:35.985
Good night.

399
25:03.265 --> 25:05.945
Actually, this is our first stop today.

400
25:06.025 --> 25:06.865
Here?

401
25:06.945 --> 25:09.705
You mean the subway station?

402
25:10.305 --> 25:11.785
A lot of people visiting Berlin

403
25:11.865 --> 25:13.465
come here to take photos.

404
25:13.545 --> 25:16.785
ALEXANDERPLATZ STATION

405
26:10.825 --> 26:13.305
SOFT-SERVE ICE CREAM

406
26:13.385 --> 26:14.265
What's going on?

407
26:14.345 --> 26:15.945
Why are you suddenly video calling me?

408
26:16.545 --> 26:18.585
You went radio silent after landing in Germany.

409
26:18.665 --> 26:19.785
I just wanted to check on you.

410
26:21.185 --> 26:24.945
I bet Zhuang Ning and Linlin are too busy and you're bored all alone.

411
26:26.065 --> 26:27.145
You caught me.

412
26:28.865 --> 26:30.265
Are you outside right now?

413
26:32.585 --> 26:33.545
Just walking around.

414
26:33.625 --> 26:34.945
Pan the camera around.

415
26:35.025 --> 26:36.145
Let me see this great Berlin.

416
26:46.305 --> 26:47.185
Wait a second.

417
26:48.305 --> 26:49.305
Turn back a little.

418
26:50.185 --> 26:51.105
A little more.

419
26:52.585 --> 26:55.305
I knew it! You went sightseeing,

420
26:55.385 --> 26:56.705
but you didn't post any photos.

421
26:56.785 --> 26:59.345
Turns out you're with Chen Yanzhou, so you were too busy to post!

422
27:00.185 --> 27:01.145
Are you two together now?

423
27:02.905 --> 27:03.785
No.

424
27:03.865 --> 27:06.465
You've been in Berlin for more than…

425
27:06.545 --> 27:09.745
More than 24 hours now, and you're still not together?

426
27:09.825 --> 27:11.065
This is killing me!

427
27:11.145 --> 27:12.865
Have you asked him yet?

428
27:14.265 --> 27:15.545
I…

429
27:15.625 --> 27:16.865
How would I ask?

430
27:17.385 --> 27:18.505
You can test the waters!

431
27:18.585 --> 27:21.705
Just spend time together as friends for now.

432
27:21.785 --> 27:24.985
If he likes you, he definitely won't want to stay just friends.

433
27:45.145 --> 27:48.025
Is this place somewhere you come often?

434
27:50.305 --> 27:52.705
Sometimes, I come here to sit by myself.

435
27:52.785 --> 27:53.985
Thinking about…

436
27:55.345 --> 27:56.585
About what?

437
27:59.065 --> 28:00.425
That

438
28:01.025 --> 28:03.945
it's such a waste to enjoy such beautiful scenery alone.

439
28:05.265 --> 28:06.225
A waste?

440
28:08.345 --> 28:10.465
Watching such a beautiful sunset alone

441
28:10.545 --> 28:13.785
is like going to a buffet and only getting a plate of salad.

442
28:15.665 --> 28:17.145
But it'll be better from now on.

443
28:17.945 --> 28:19.305
We can take our time and enjoy it.

444
28:22.665 --> 28:26.985
Then from now on, if you ever feel lonely and want to go somewhere to relax,

445
28:27.065 --> 28:28.145
just come find me.

446
28:28.225 --> 28:29.065
I'll be here.

447
28:30.305 --> 28:31.625
Really?

448
28:32.185 --> 28:34.425
Just spend time together as friends for now.

449
28:34.505 --> 28:37.265
If he likes you, he definitely won't want to stay just friends.

450
28:39.265 --> 28:42.745
After all, I don't really know anyone else here.

451
28:52.865 --> 28:54.025
No problem.

452
28:58.465 --> 29:02.105
Thanks for taking me to so many great places today.

453
29:03.745 --> 29:05.305
You're thanking me too soon.

454
29:05.385 --> 29:07.705
There are still so many places we haven't been to yet.

455
29:50.425 --> 29:52.105
How's it going?

456
29:52.185 --> 29:53.665
XU FANGLI

457
29:53.745 --> 29:56.425
I tested the waters last time and there wasn't much reaction.

458
29:56.505 --> 29:59.145
I've been busy these past few days, so we haven't seen each other much.

459
30:01.265 --> 30:02.905
Keep probing and report back!

460
30:06.425 --> 30:09.825
NEW MESSAGE: CHEN YANZHOU

461
30:09.905 --> 30:11.385
Are you still in class?

462
30:14.345 --> 30:15.945
Classes are over.

463
30:19.225 --> 30:21.345
What are you doing later?

464
30:24.665 --> 30:25.745
Studying.

465
30:28.665 --> 30:29.665
What about you?

466
31:21.545 --> 31:22.905
I'm planning to study too.

467
31:28.865 --> 31:30.785
ZHENG YU: STUDYING. WHAT ABOUT YOU?

468
31:30.865 --> 31:33.505
You traveled an hour all the way over here

469
31:33.585 --> 31:35.305
just to study at our campus?

470
31:35.825 --> 31:37.865
And you insisted on dragging me along!

471
31:39.425 --> 31:41.145
Aren't you going on a business trip tomorrow?

472
31:42.665 --> 31:44.185
I'm just helping you graduate sooner.

473
31:45.905 --> 31:46.745
Thanks a lot.

474
31:48.745 --> 31:51.625
Besides, at your university, you're the only…

475
31:53.265 --> 31:55.185
No, you're one of the only two people I know.

476
31:55.705 --> 31:57.345
It's not like I had any other options.

477
31:58.105 --> 31:59.225
Two?

478
32:00.505 --> 32:02.945
Look at you! When did you meet someone new behind my back?

479
32:08.305 --> 32:10.905
You're distracted. You're not really here to see me, are you?

480
32:13.625 --> 32:15.945
I told you, I'm here to study with you.

481
32:17.065 --> 32:18.385
Total nonsense.

482
32:18.465 --> 32:21.065
Whatever your reason is, can we eat first?

483
32:23.425 --> 32:24.465
Fine.

484
32:26.665 --> 32:28.265
ZHENG YU

485
32:28.345 --> 32:29.945
Have you eaten yet?

486
32:38.905 --> 32:40.305
You still haven't answered me.

487
32:40.385 --> 32:42.905
When did you meet this new person from our university?

488
32:43.905 --> 32:45.865
It's not someone new. It's an old friend.

489
32:47.065 --> 32:47.945
An old friend?

490
32:52.465 --> 32:54.305
So you had an ulterior motive all along.

491
32:54.385 --> 32:58.025
Since you're old friends, why use studying as an excuse?

492
32:58.105 --> 32:59.185
Why not just go see her?

493
33:01.345 --> 33:03.505
I came here without telling her beforehand.

494
33:04.105 --> 33:07.705
If I suddenly tell her I'm nearby and ask to see her,

495
33:07.785 --> 33:10.145
wouldn't that put a lot of pressure on her?

496
33:13.905 --> 33:14.825
Oh, Chen Yanzhou.

497
33:14.905 --> 33:18.385
I really never expected you'd be like this when falling in love.

498
33:18.465 --> 33:20.145
-Like what? -One word.

499
33:21.345 --> 33:22.745
Cowardly.

500
33:24.305 --> 33:25.425
You wouldn't understand.

501
33:25.505 --> 33:28.105
I don't get you. What's there to be afraid of?

502
33:28.185 --> 33:29.665
Did she reject you before?

503
33:34.465 --> 33:36.465
No way. She really did?

504
33:39.065 --> 33:40.665
I confessed my feelings to her in China.

505
33:40.745 --> 33:43.385
Basically, she felt pressured by it.

506
33:43.465 --> 33:45.065
So I'm not really sure

507
33:45.905 --> 33:47.225
where to draw the line anymore.

508
33:48.185 --> 33:52.545
Then you need to communicate more to figure out where her boundaries are.

509
33:52.625 --> 33:54.465
Listen to me. Ask her out now.

510
33:55.705 --> 33:57.505
No. I already asked her.

511
33:57.585 --> 33:58.785
She's studying tonight.

512
33:58.865 --> 34:02.385
She's not like you, making travel plans halfway through studying,

513
34:02.465 --> 34:03.945
playing video games during class,

514
34:04.025 --> 34:06.225
and grabbing a drink before heading to the library.

515
34:06.305 --> 34:07.265
She's different.

516
34:07.345 --> 34:08.185
Hey, you…

517
34:26.465 --> 34:28.665
Hi. I'm Lai Wendong.

518
34:28.744 --> 34:30.585
You can call me Leon, like everyone else.

519
34:30.665 --> 34:33.105
I'm in biology too, a year ahead of you.

520
34:33.185 --> 34:35.705
Let's chat more and exchange ideas in the future.

521
34:36.705 --> 34:38.465
-Cheers to you. -Cheers.

522
34:46.025 --> 34:48.425
If she's studying, just ask her another time.

523
34:48.505 --> 34:49.905
There's no need to drown your sorrows.

524
34:53.625 --> 34:54.945
The same.

525
34:55.025 --> 34:55.905
Make it two.

526
35:03.985 --> 35:05.065
You…

527
35:08.665 --> 35:10.265
That girl's Chinese, right?

528
35:12.985 --> 35:14.025
And she's pretty cute.

529
35:14.945 --> 35:16.825
But you don't need to keep staring at her like that.

530
35:29.465 --> 35:30.785
She's the second person?

531
36:06.505 --> 36:08.585
Meet me at the entrance when you're done.

532
36:08.665 --> 36:09.705
I need to talk to you.

533
36:22.465 --> 36:23.665
Chen Yanzhou.

534
36:31.425 --> 36:32.785
Are you

535
36:33.385 --> 36:34.505
drunk?

536
36:39.505 --> 36:40.865
Liar.

537
36:40.945 --> 36:43.305
You were texting me just a moment ago.

538
36:46.625 --> 36:48.305
This drink has a strong delayed kick.

539
36:49.385 --> 36:50.425
I had a lot just now.

540
36:51.785 --> 36:53.305
Why did you drink so much?

541
36:57.785 --> 36:58.945
Because you lied to me.

542
37:01.825 --> 37:03.505
You were clearly at a gathering,

543
37:04.265 --> 37:06.945
yet you lied and said you were studying.

544
37:09.705 --> 37:11.825
I really was studying.

545
37:11.905 --> 37:13.705
I was practicing my conversation skills.

546
37:13.785 --> 37:16.705
What about you? Didn't you say you were studying?

547
37:17.505 --> 37:18.825
I was afraid of disturbing you,

548
37:18.905 --> 37:20.105
so I didn't even dare text you.

549
37:20.705 --> 37:21.705
I…

550
37:24.665 --> 37:25.585
I was studying.

551
37:26.745 --> 37:28.305
I was learning from you.

552
37:28.945 --> 37:29.945
You went to a gathering,

553
37:30.745 --> 37:31.785
so I went to one too.

554
37:36.265 --> 37:37.625
You

555
37:37.705 --> 37:38.585
can't smile.

556
37:39.865 --> 37:41.145
Why not?

557
37:42.625 --> 37:44.545
Because whenever I see you smile,

558
37:46.025 --> 37:47.785
I end up forgiving you for everything.

559
37:54.985 --> 37:55.825
I…

560
37:56.425 --> 37:58.985
Actually, I was going to the library today.

561
37:59.985 --> 38:01.825
My housemate, Lena,

562
38:01.905 --> 38:03.385
invited me to the gathering.

563
38:03.465 --> 38:06.705
She's really nice, so I said yes.

564
38:10.145 --> 38:10.985
Me too.

565
38:11.945 --> 38:13.065
I…

566
38:13.785 --> 38:16.425
was going to the library hoping to run into you.

567
38:17.105 --> 38:18.185
But then

568
38:19.105 --> 38:20.745
Qin Shizi dragged me out to eat.

569
38:24.025 --> 38:25.105
Okay.

570
38:25.185 --> 38:27.865
Now that the misunderstanding is cleared up,

571
38:27.945 --> 38:29.545
let's go.

572
38:38.305 --> 38:39.145
I…

573
38:40.625 --> 38:41.985
can't walk anymore.

574
38:46.065 --> 38:47.065
Chen Yanzhou.

575
38:47.705 --> 38:48.865
Are you

576
38:49.425 --> 38:50.865
trying to act cute?

577
38:52.105 --> 38:53.145
Stop pretending.

578
38:53.225 --> 38:54.545
I know you can walk.

579
38:59.145 --> 39:01.145
I'm not the only one who gets drunk.

580
39:01.945 --> 39:04.305
Why does someone else get to act completely spoiled,

581
39:04.385 --> 39:06.145
while I get this kind of treatment?

582
39:07.265 --> 39:09.505
You really hold a grudge, don't you?

583
39:11.185 --> 39:12.465
Didn't I tell you?

584
39:13.305 --> 39:14.265
You

585
39:15.225 --> 39:16.425
can't smile.

586
39:18.105 --> 39:19.305
I'm going to smile anyway.

587
39:20.025 --> 39:21.465
What are you going to do about it?

588
39:33.945 --> 39:36.465
How about I help you walk?

589
40:03.945 --> 40:04.865
Chen Yanzhou.

590
40:05.705 --> 40:08.905
Some things should wait until you're sober.

591
40:13.025 --> 40:15.345
You've had too much to drink. Let me take you home.

592
40:28.785 --> 40:29.785
The keys?

593
40:53.065 --> 40:54.105
This way.

594
40:57.345 --> 40:58.305
Be careful.

595
41:02.745 --> 41:03.945
Come on, sit down.

596
41:41.305 --> 41:42.465
Chen Yanzhou.

597
41:43.065 --> 41:44.425
Actually,

598
41:45.105 --> 41:48.225
there's something I've been wanting to ask you these past few days.

599
41:49.545 --> 41:50.785
You…

600
44:33.265 --> 44:38.265
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
